  "readme": "# Kling O3\n\nA single endpoint for Kling O3: text-to-video, image-to-video (with optional end frame), reference images, and video reference in one schema. Pick the tier with `resolution`.\n\n## Pick an input mode\n\n| Mode | Send |\n|---|---|\n| Text | `prompt` only |\n| Frames | `image`, optional `end_image` |\n| References | `images` (refer to them as @Image1, …) |\n| Video reference | `video`, optional `images` |\n\n## Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Default | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `prompt` | string, required | — | Up to 2,500 characters. |\n| `resolution` | `standard` / `pro` / `4k` | `standard` | Tier: `standard`, `pro`, or `4k`; sets the per-second rate. |\n| `image` | image URL | — | Optional first frame. |\n| `video` | video URL | — | Optional reference video. |\n| `keep_original_sound` | boolean | true | Keep the reference video's audio track. |\n| `character_orientation` | `image` / `video` | — | `video` follows the reference video's orientation (better for complex moves, up to 30s); `image` follows the image (better for camera moves, up to 10s). |\n| `end_image` | image URL | — | Optional last frame. |\n| `images` | image URL[] | — | Reference images, referred to as @Image1, @Image2, … in the prompt. |\n| `duration` | 3–15 | 5 | Output length in seconds. |\n| `aspect_ratio` | `16:9` / `9:16` / `1:1` | `16:9` | Output frame shape. |\n| `generate_audio` | boolean | true | Generate native audio with the clip. |\n| `shot_type` | `customize` / `intelligent` | `customize` | `customize` follows your `multi_prompt` shot list; `intelligent` lets the model plan the cuts. |\n| `multi_prompt` | object[] | — | Optional list of shots, each with its own prompt and duration. |\n\n## Billing\n\nYou pay per output second. Standard: $0.112 with audio, $0.084 without. Pro: $0.14 with audio, $0.112 without. 4K: $0.42. With a reference `video`: $0.126 (standard) or $0.168 (pro).\n\n| Output | standard | pro | 4k |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 5s with audio | $0.56 | $0.70 | $2.10 |\n| 5s without audio | $0.42 | $0.56 | $2.10 |\n| 5s with reference video | $0.63 | $0.84 | $2.10 |\n| 10s with audio | $1.12 | $1.40 | $4.20 |\n\nFailed runs are not charged.\n\n## Prompting\n\n- Describe subject, action, camera move, and light in order.\n- For several shots, use `multi_prompt` with one entry per shot.\n- Refer to references as @Image1, @Video1.\n\n## Limits\n\n- Clips are 3–15 seconds.\n\n## Also on SandBase\n\nRelated: `kwaivgi/kling-video/o3/pro/text-to-video` (single-mode endpoint), `kwaivgi/kling-video/o3/pro/image-to-video` (single-mode endpoint).\n",
